Nightlife","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Wine Bars","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Beer","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Wine & Spirits","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Beer, Food, Nightlife, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"eKgtzwzbLR44fqevm6yUSQ","review_id":"NOtvqyEX8kpi6Am5OymR7w","date":"2016-07-31T14:48:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.937579333782196,"text_excerpt":"This is a great place to satiate your wine fix. Fans and I came here for wine tasting Wednesday. I've never been here before, but as usually for the hidden Marigny spots, it was a great surprise. Other than my bestie smokey the bear (whom I tamed - see pics) there is an abundance of goodies to enjoy here. You can bring your kids here and your pets so no excuses to not stop by. There are two window seating areas (one with a chess board) and more seating in the back- We didn't partake in the cheese plate but it did look pretty good (if that's your kind of thing). The staff isn't pushy and the customers are all smiles. I give this place two thumbs way way up there."},{"business_id":"eKgtzwzbLR44fqevm6yUSQ","review_id":"qyA4s0v-Uoy7U-fXkJ1GSA","date":"2019-01-30T01:24:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9315016865730286,"text_excerpt":"This is a gem of a place. They have a beautiful selection of wines from all over the world and they have several choices of $5 wines to enjoy on site. There's several choices for red, white and sparkly alike. It's a great place to chill with friends and work also because they have WiFi. They have cheese and crackers that they will plate for you as well as other gourmet mustards and packaged seafood. I love the ambiance here with the wooden tables and alcoves. The fact that it's a wine shop and a place to hang out is amazing."},{"business_id":"eKgtzwzbLR44fqevm6yUSQ","review_id":"UwR3h5UExSC4oSYMFMSweg","date":"2021-05-28T17:01:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.929148256778717,"text_excerpt":"This is one of my favorite wine shops in the city. They are open again for shopping inside and they have a great selection of unique wines. The staff are great, super knowledgeable, and happy to order things if you have specific wines in mind. Hopefully they start doing wine by the glass again soon!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"eKgtzwzbLR44fqevm6yUSQ","photo_id":"b9hr0mM3tL4t_i_XX0-g7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/b9hr0mM3tL4t_i_XX0-g7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
